	(text "NOTE:\nThe OSDZU3 reference design can be powered from a 12V Power Adapter (min 3A).\nThe Power Adapter input is on Sheet 10 and feed the main 5V regulator.  A jumper\nis provided to power the 5V input directly, if necessary.\nAdditionally, a jumper is provided to allow the main 5V power rail to power USB-C\ndevices or to allow attachement of a separate regulated 5V output."
